ND TOGETHER!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271930/extras/9cd0c87e0d834a54cd31f43ddcd4bd36.poster.avif?t=1783660051\" width=1170 height=617 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271930/extras/9cd0c87e0d834a54cd31f43ddcd4bd36.webm?t=1783660051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, share resources, and strategize for survival. Join forces with your allies to face the lurking dangers of Luminora!</p>", "short_description": "「IfSunSets」 is a survival RPG adventure game. During the day, secure necessary supplies across the island, and survive the night against strong and terrifying monsters that track you down. You can utilize resources you've secured to build a base to fend off threatening monsters.", "supported_languages": "English, Korean, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish, Hindi, Arabic", "reviews": "“it works and is scary as hell”<br>Digital Chumps<br><br>“if you don’t know what to expect, you’ll never see it coming”<br>Massively Overpowered<br><br>“IfSunSets pulls together elements from other games and makes them mesh”<br>COG connected<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271930/b891be414f976cd22bb5dfc766654d1fd9d22775/header.jpg?t=1783660051", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271930/1d6488fef3d4be7ed32cab38f662eab7feef21c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783660051", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271930/1d6488fef3d4be7ed32cab38f662eab7feef21c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783660051", "website": null, "pc